{
  "title": "Yellow Indian Mulukhiyah Palak Paneer",
  "description": "A one-pot Indian dish featuring mulukhiyah and paneer in a palak sauce, cooked in a banana leaf vessel. This resinous and bouncy dish is onion and garlic free, making it friendly for all diets.",
  "cuisine": "Indian",
